Description: PBX3 - API-driven configurator for Asterisk
 PBX3 provides backend code to configure and build Asterisk dialplans
 on the fly. Target: Ubuntu 24.04 LTS (Noble). Run
 /opt/pbx3/scripts/installer.sh after install for full setup (Apache,
 fail2ban, DB, CDR MySQL, instance id).
